  "module_docs": [
    "Port of `net.minestom.server.network.packet.server.play.SetTimePacket`.",
    "",
    "# Deferrals",
    "",
    "Java's map key is `RegistryKey<WorldClock>`, written through",
    "`RegistryNetworkTypes.RegistryKeyImpl`, which resolves the key against the",
    "live registries carried by the buffer (`buffer.registries()`) and writes its",
    "numeric id. The port's buffer has no registry table, so a clock entry is",
    "carried as that numeric id; a server binds the id back to a key when it",
    "builds the packet."
  ],
